                        ],
                        "form": "безвла́стиях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c428c68-e488-3e78-ba16-d682b85491df",
                        "entry_id": "fbfa627e-5697-3ef5-bac9-29ee975157fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "отсутствие государственной власти, отсутствие руководства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e3e7c9c1-1334-47f1-87b8-0f825aa99e82",
                        "source_entry_id": "fbfa627e-5697-3ef5-bac9-29ee975157fa",
                        "source_sense_id": "5c428c68-e488-3e78-ba16-d682b85491df",
                        "target_lang_word": "anarchy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anarchy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2085bbf4-b4c7-38d6-985a-0338e63b71fa",
                                        "entry_id": "80b772ad-affc-3ec1-823c-982e6252fe60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of a society being without authorities or an authoritative governing body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3b27682-901f-436c-ac73-fb627c7ef366",
                                                "sense_id": "2085bbf4-b4c7-38d6-985a-0338e63b71fa",
                                                "text": "La propriété et la royauté sont en démolition dès le commencement du monde ; comme l’homme cherche la justice dans l’égalité, la société cherche l’ordre dans l’anarchie.\nAnarchie, absence de maître, de souverain, telle est la forme de gouvernement dont nous approchons tous les jours, et que l’habitude invétérée de prendre l’homme pour règle et sa volonté pour loi nous fait regarder comme le comble du désordre et l’expression du chaos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a097d8ce-ee69-4d73-a0b0-3c8df3f7cc88",
                                                "sense_id": "2085bbf4-b4c7-38d6-985a-0338e63b71fa",
                                                "text": "Oui, l’anarchie c’est l'ordre; car, le gouvernement c’est la guerre civile.",
                                                "translation": "Anarchy, a Journal of Order",
                                                "english": "Anarchy, a Journal of Order"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "483a97f4-adee-4cd5-894a-5e3334752e09",
                                                "sense_id": "2085bbf4-b4c7-38d6-985a-0338e63b71fa",
                                                "text": "Rather than democracy, justice as well as economic efficiency require a pure and unrestricted private property society – an ‘anarchy of production’ – in which no one rules anybody, and all producers’ relations are voluntary, and thus mutually beneficial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db94ade1-e53a-393a-bd1a-14912f8ba123",
                                        "entry_id": "80b772ad-affc-3ec1-823c-982e6252fe60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The political theory that a community is best organized by the voluntary cooperation of individuals, rather than by a government, which is regarded as being coercive by nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a46125e-ef43-498b-ae87-00b7c58ba0d3",
                                                "sense_id": "db94ade1-e53a-393a-bd1a-14912f8ba123",
                                                "text": "Своею полемикою против них мы довели их до сознания, что свобода или анархия, т. е. вольная организация ра­бочих масс снизу вверх, есть окончательная цель общественного развития, и что всякое государство, не исключая и их народного, есть ярмо, значит с одной стороны порождает деспотизм, а с другой рабство.\nОни говорят, что такое государственное ярмо-диктатура есть необходимое переходное средство для достижения полнейшего народного освобождения: анархия или свобода — цель, государство или дикта­тура — средство. Итак для освобождения народных масс надо их сперва поработить.",
                                                "translation": "Mikhail Bakunin",
                                                "english": "Mikhail Bakunin"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16adedf6-3103-4b82-b480-986036b5f875",
                                                "sense_id": "db94ade1-e53a-393a-bd1a-14912f8ba123",
                                                "text": "Libertarianism is the view that each man is the absolute owner of his life, to use and dispose of as he sees fit: that all man's social actions should be voluntary: and that respect for every other man's similar and equal ownership of life and, by extension, the property and fruits of that life, is the ethical basis of a humane and open society. In this view, the only — repeat, only — function of law or government is to provide the sort of self-defense against violence that an individual, if he were powerful enough, would provide for himself.\nIf it were not for the fact that libertarianism freely concedes the right of men voluntarily to form communities or governments on the same ethical basis, libertarianism could be called anarchy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e7ae826-c8ef-4164-831a-194f4c1085db",
                                                "sense_id": "db94ade1-e53a-393a-bd1a-14912f8ba123",
                                                "text": "Well, anarchism is, in my view, basically a kind of tendency in human thought which shows up in different forms in different circumstances, and has some leading characteristics. Primarily it is a tendency that is suspicious and skeptical of domination, authority, and hierarchy. It seeks structures of hierarchy and domination in human life over the whole range, extending from, say, patriarchal families to, say, imperial systems, and it asks whether those systems are justified. It assumes that the burden of proof for anyone in a position of power and authority lies on them. Their authority is not self-justifying. They have to give a reason for it, a justification. And if they can’t justify that authority and power and control, which is the usual case, then the authority ought to be dismantled and replaced by something more free and just. And, as I understand it, anarchy is just that tendency. It takes different forms at different times."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8ed0f18-6f32-31b3-b59c-5bb4b53463c5",
                                        "entry_id": "80b772ad-affc-3ec1-823c-982e6252fe60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chaotic and confusing absence of any form of political authority or government."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84fa8edf-37d7-4a04-aebd-044a40d7e8cc",
                                                "sense_id": "c8ed0f18-6f32-31b3-b59c-5bb4b53463c5",
                                                "text": "And each dweller, panic-stricken,\nFelt his heart with terror sicken\nHearing the tempestuous cry\nOf the triumph of Anarchy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e65c4778-dc60-4e11-ba72-a54da80e1c9c",
                                                "sense_id": "c8ed0f18-6f32-31b3-b59c-5bb4b53463c5",
                                                "text": "Anarchy still reigns in this new country;—not only have the miners to defend their persons and their acquisitions against the incursions from Indian tribes; not only are crimes and offences common (lynch law maintaining a permitted existence instead of laws and police); but every one appears to hold his property by right of first comer: a miner choses the spot he likes best; a strong arm and a carbine, with a steady eye, are his title deeds. To seize upon a rich \"placer\" from a miner too weak to resist, is called in the slang of the district, to \"jump a claim.\" The President of the United States himself, stated in his last message, that \"The mineral lands should remain free to every citizen;\" and the Secretary of State has added, \"that the right of occupancy should be submitted only to such laws as the miners themselves thought fit to make.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "598831f3-35ec-37db-bfbd-14a12c1e1c11",
                                        "entry_id": "80b772ad-affc-3ec1-823c-982e6252fe60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confusion in general; disorder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d246ccea-8c19-42ea-b2dd-b0da8f6c8584",
                                                "sense_id": "598831f3-35ec-37db-bfbd-14a12c1e1c11",
                                                "text": "It was total anarchy in the clothes shop on Black Friday as soon as they opened the doors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1322af98-5880-4a78-8b6e-d2199f41438c",
                                                "sense_id": "598831f3-35ec-37db-bfbd-14a12c1e1c11",
                                                "text": "Der Widerspruch zwischen gesellschaftlicher Produktion und kapitalistischer Aneignung stellt sich nun dar als Gegensatz zwischen der Organisation der Produktion in der einzelnen Fabrik und der Anarchie der Produktion in der ganzen Gesellschaft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47737f96-a8cb-45fa-9018-59dd7ffc4c7a",
                                                "sense_id": "598831f3-35ec-37db-bfbd-14a12c1e1c11",
                                                "text": "The economic anarchy of capitalist society as it exists today is, in my opinion, the real source of the evil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2e1b8d5-d19b-4eb6-b891-d7b18bce5fb6",
                        "source_entry_id": "fbfa627e-5697-3ef5-bac9-29ee975157fa",
                        "source_sense_id": "5c428c68-e488-3e78-ba16-d682b85491df",
                        "target_lang_word": "anarchie",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anarchie",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29304eb0-a82d-36df-a58f-cf1fcc1a1611",
                                        "entry_id": "59673cd9-4a12-3fc7-9c48-d7d6175e3805",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het ontbreken van een geordend bestuur, regeringsloosheid"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7ddda4e-5987-459c-a687-d9b8f03f50a4",
                                                "sense_id": "29304eb0-a82d-36df-a58f-cf1fcc1a1611",
                                                "text": "Er zijn een paar staten in de wereld waar geen functionerende staat meer is en er een feitelijke anarchie is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6acf8a60-842b-4da9-adfa-fc2a971bedb3",
                                                "sense_id": "29304eb0-a82d-36df-a58f-cf1fcc1a1611",
                                                "text": "Hier, op het platteland, heerst anarchie der dingen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4f85b04-6cc3-4d12-9e20-95e55eb25773",
                                                "sense_id": "29304eb0-a82d-36df-a58f-cf1fcc1a1611",
                                                "text": "Want zelfs hij, gepokt en gemazeld als hij was in het cynische New Yorkse zakenleven, had zich van tevoren onmogelijk een voorstelling kunnen maken van de totale anarchie die deze stad in haar beginjaren beheerste."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61ba1adf-e949-3899-9c49-ac0fefaa9d95",
                                        "entry_id": "59673cd9-4a12-3fc7-9c48-d7d6175e3805",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "wanorde"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e19858e2-4ce6-40e2-a10f-8dd67d5e2153",
                                                "sense_id": "61ba1adf-e949-3899-9c49-ac0fefaa9d95",
                                                "text": "In deze populistische partij is geen discipline, het is een totale anarchie, maar wel een gezellige anarchie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c6c1918-d837-4e2b-a322-c216011fae1b",
                                                "sense_id": "61ba1adf-e949-3899-9c49-ac0fefaa9d95",
                                                "text": "cuby and the blizzards window of my eyescuby and the blizzards window of my eyes: Natuurlijk zijn ze in Assen onverminderd trots op 'hun' Harry. Gastconservator Albert Haar noemt hem graag een icoon voor Drenthe, een voorbeeld voor de provinciale jeugd. Maar Muskee was natuurlijk meer dan dat. Met zijn muziek en zijn dwarsheid was hij een exponent van de anarchie van de jaren zestig. Die levenshouding bracht hem fans in heel Nederland."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2d17e73-d22e-368e-b825-077589a21b97",
                                        "entry_id": "59673cd9-4a12-3fc7-9c48-d7d6175e3805",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "samenleving die is gebaseerd op een van de richtingen van het anarchisme"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e693cc3-9ee2-4b21-84df-5929b1792ee6",
                                                "sense_id": "b2d17e73-d22e-368e-b825-077589a21b97",
                                                "text": "Liberijnen staan een soort van anarchie voor zonder dat ze het zo willen noemen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
